<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>The Complete Language Industry Atlas — Interactive Bookshelf & OpenLoc AI Workbench</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Explore all 20 Volumes of The Complete Language Industry Atlas on an interactive bookshelf, query 11 relational industry databases, and test live Quality Prediction (QE), Automatic Post-Editing (APE), and OpenLoc tools — 100% open."
    />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Instrument+Serif:ital@0;1&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      :root {
        --bg-cream: #f7f4ee;
        --bg-paper: #ffffff;
        --bg-shelf: #efeae0;
        --bg-dark: #121316;
        --bg-dark-card: #1a1c20;
        --ink-primary: #141413;
        --ink-secondary: #4a4843;
        --ink-muted: #78756e;
        --border-subtle: #e2ddd3;
        --border-strong: #c8c1b4;
        --accent-amber: #b45309;
        --accent-emerald: #047857;
        --accent-emerald-bg: #ecfdf5;
        --wood-ledge: linear-gradient(180deg, #d8cfc0 0%, #c2b6a3 45%, #a89b87 100%);
        --shadow-book: 0 14px 28px -8px rgba(20, 20, 19, 0.28), 0 4px 10px -2px rgba(20, 20, 19, 0.16);
        --shadow-book-hover: 0 24px 44px -10px rgba(20, 20, 19, 0.38), 0 10px 20px -4px rgba(20, 20, 19, 0.22);
        --font-serif: 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif;
        --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
        --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
        background-color: var(--bg-cream);
        color: var(--ink-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
      }

      body {
        min-height: 100vh;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* Top Sticky Navigation Bar */
      .topbar {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 100;
        background: rgba(247, 244, 238, 0.92);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      }

      .topbar-inner {
        max-width: 1400px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .brand {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink-primary);
      }

      .brand-title {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.55rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .brand-tag {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        padding: 0.18rem 0.5rem;
        background: var(--accent-emerald-bg);
        color: var(--accent-emerald);
        border: 1px solid rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.25);
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink-secondary);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: color 0.15s ease;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover {
        color: var(--ink-primary);
      }

      .nav-cta {
        background: var(--ink-primary);
        color: #ffffff !important;
        padding: 0.48rem 0.95rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.84rem !important;
        font-weight: 600 !important;
      }

      .nav-cta:hover {
        background: #2c2b29;
      }

      /* Container */
      .container {
        max-width: 1400px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 2rem;
      }

      /* Hero & Live Industry Counter Header */
      .hero {
        padding: 3.5rem 0 2.25rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 0.65fr;
        gap: 2.5rem;
        align-items: end;
      }

      .hero-eyebrow {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--accent-amber);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.6rem;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 4.7vw, 4.25rem);
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.06;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
        color: var(--ink-primary);
        margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
      }

      .hero-lead {
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        color: var(--ink-secondary);
        max-width: 68ch;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .hero-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .btn-primary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        background: var(--ink-primary);
        color: #ffffff;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.72rem 1.25rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
        border: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .btn-primary:hover {
        background: #292826;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
      }

      .btn-secondary {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        background: var(--bg-paper);
        color: var(--ink-primary);
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 0.72rem 1.2rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        transition: background 0.15s ease;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .btn-secondary:hover {
        background: var(--bg-shelf);
      }

      .hero-metrics {
        background: var(--bg-paper);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 1.1rem;
      }

      .metric-box {
        border-left: 2px solid var(--ink-primary);
        padding-left: 0.85rem;
      }

      .metric-val {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.85rem;
        line-height: 1.05;
        color: var(--ink-primary);
      }

      .metric-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        margin-top: 0.2rem;
      }

      /* Architecture Quick Ribbon */
      .arch-ribbon {
        padding: 1.25rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      }

      .arch-ribbon-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      .arch-ribbon-title {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
      }

      .arch-pills {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(175px, 1fr));
        gap: 0.65rem;
      }

      .arch-pill {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.2rem;
        padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
        background: var(--bg-paper);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        border-radius: 8px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink-primary);
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
      }

      .arch-pill:hover {
        border-color: var(--ink-primary);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }

      .arch-pill-top {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .arch-pill-num {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        color: var(--accent-amber);
        background: #fef3c7;
        padding: 0.1rem 0.38rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      .arch-pill-desc {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        line-height: 1.35;
      }

      /* THE SHELF OF BOOKS SECTION */
      .bookshelf-section {
        padding: 2.75rem 0 3.5rem;
      }

      .shelf-controls {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 1rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      .shelf-heading h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      .shelf-heading p {
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: var(--ink-secondary);
        margin-top: 0.25rem;
      }

      .filter-bar {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .filter-btn {
        background: var(--bg-paper);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        color: var(--ink-secondary);
        padding: 0.45rem 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.15s ease;
      }

      .filter-btn:hover,
      .filter-btn.active {
        background: var(--ink-primary);
        color: #ffffff;
        border-color: var(--ink-primary);
      }

      .shelf-search {
        padding: 0.46rem 0.85rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: var(--bg-paper);
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        min-width: 220px;
        color: var(--ink-primary);
      }

      /* Physical Bookshelf Grid */
      .bookshelf-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(235px, 1fr));
        gap: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
        padding: 1.5rem 1.5rem 2.25rem;
        background: var(--bg-shelf);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: inset 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      }

      /* Individual Book on the Shelf */
      .book-slot {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        position: relative;
        padding-bottom: 14px;
        border-bottom: 10px solid #c5b8a5;
        transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
      }

      .book-card {
        width: 100%;
        height: 310px;
        border-radius: 4px 10px 10px 4px;
        position: relative;
        display: flex;
        cursor: pointer;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-book);
        transition: transform 0.28s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 0.28s ease;
        transform-origin: bottom center;
        overflow: hidden;
        user-select: none;
      }

      .book-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-10px) rotate(-1deg);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-book-hover);
      }

      /* Left Bound Book Spine Crease */
      .book-spine {
        width: 28px;
        height: 100%;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 0.75rem 0;
        border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.26);
        box-shadow: inset -3px 0 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      }

      .spine-num {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .spine-roman {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      }

      /* Book Front Cover */
      .book-cover {
        flex: 1;
        padding: 1.15rem 1.15rem 1rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: space-between;
        color: #f8fafc;
        position: relative;
      }

      /* Subtle Page Edge Effect on Right */
      .book-cover::after {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 3px;
        right: 0;
        bottom: 3px;
        width: 4px;
        background: repeating-linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85),
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85) 1px,
          #d6d3cd 1px,
          #d6d3cd 2px
        );
        opacity: 0.75;
      }

      .book-top-meta {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 0.4rem;
      }

      .book-layer-tag {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.63rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
      }

      .book-ai-pill {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.62rem;
        padding: 0.1rem 0.38rem;
        border-radius: 3px;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      }

      .book-title-area {
        margin: 0.6rem 0;
      }

      .book-vol-label {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        display: block;
      }

      .book-title {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 1.62rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.08;
        margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
        color: #ffffff;
      }

      .book-subtitle {
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        line-height: 1.38;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78);
      }

      .book-bottom-meta {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        padding-top: 0.65rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.66rem;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      }

      .book-open-cta {
        font-weight: 600;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.25rem;
      }

      /* Book Reader Drawer / Modal when you click any book */
      .book-drawer-backdrop {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(15, 16, 18, 0.55);
        backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
        z-index: 200;
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .book-drawer-backdrop.open {
        display: flex;
      }

      .book-drawer {
        background: var(--bg-paper);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: 12px;
        max-width: 780px;
        width: 100%;
        max-height: 88vh;
        overflow-y: auto;
        box-shadow: 0 28px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        padding: 2rem;
        position: relative;
      }

      .drawer-close {
        position: absolute;
        top: 1.25rem;
        right: 1.25rem;
        background: var(--bg-shelf);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 0.35rem 0.7rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .drawer-eyebrow {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--accent-amber);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      }

      .drawer-title {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 2.35rem;
        line-height: 1.1;
        margin: 0.35rem 0 0.5rem;
      }

      .drawer-summary {
        font-size: 0.96rem;
        color: var(--ink-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
        padding-bottom: 1.15rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      }

      .drawer-chapters-title {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.76rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      .drawer-chapter-list {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.55rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .drawer-chapter-list a {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
        background: var(--bg-cream);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        border-radius: 7px;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--ink-primary);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
      }

      .drawer-chapter-list a:hover {
        border-color: var(--ink-primary);
        background: #efeae0;
      }

      .drawer-actions {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      /* LIVE MODELFRONT & OPENLOC AI WORKBENCH SECTION */
      .workbench-section {
        background: var(--bg-dark);
        color: #f3f4f6;
        padding: 4rem 0;
        border-top: 1px solid #272a30;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #272a30;
      }

      .workbench-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-end;
        gap: 2rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      }

      .workbench-header h2 {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 2.55rem;
        font-weight: 400;
        color: #ffffff;
        line-height: 1.08;
      }

      .workbench-header p {
        color: #9ca3af;
        max-width: 65ch;
        margin-top: 0.45rem;
        font-size: 0.96rem;
      }

      .workbench-tabs {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .wb-tab {
        background: var(--bg-dark-card);
        color: #9ca3af;
        border: 1px solid #2e323b;
        padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.15s ease;
      }

      .wb-tab.active,
      .wb-tab:hover {
        background: #f59e0b;
        color: #111827;
        border-color: #f59e0b;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .wb-panel {
        display: none;
        background: var(--bg-dark-card);
        border: 1px solid #2e323b;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 1.75rem;
      }

      .wb-panel.active {
        display: block;
      }

      .wb-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 1.75rem;
      }

      .wb-field {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .wb-label {
        display: block;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #9ca3af;
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
      }

      .wb-select,
      .wb-input,
      .wb-textarea {
        width: 100%;
        background: #111317;
        border: 1px solid #343842;
        color: #f9fafb;
        padding: 0.65rem 0.85rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.84rem;
      }

      .wb-textarea {
        min-height: 92px;
        resize: vertical;
      }

      .wb-output-card {
        background: #111317;
        border: 1px solid #2e323b;
        border-radius: 8px;
        padding: 1.25rem;
      }

      .qe-score-banner {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        padding-bottom: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #262930;
      }

      .qe-score-big {
        font-family: var(--font-serif);
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        line-height: 1;
      }

      .qe-decision-badge {
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.65rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .qe-checks {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.78rem;
      }

      /* Relational Databases Shelf Tab Explorer */
      .db-section {
        padding: 3.5rem 0 4rem;
      }

      .db-tabs {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.45rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        margin: 1.25rem 0;
      }

      .db-tab {
        background: var(--bg-paper);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        color: var(--ink-secondary);
        padding: 0.48rem 0.9rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .db-tab.active,
      .db-tab:hover {
        background: var(--ink-primary);
        color: #ffffff;
        border-color: var(--ink-primary);
      }

      .db-panel {
        display: none;
        background: var(--bg-paper);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow-x: auto;
      }

      .db-panel.active {
        display: block;
      }

      table.clean-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        text-align: left;
      }

      table.clean-table th {
        background: var(--bg-shelf);
        color: var(--ink-primary);
        font-family: var(--font-mono);
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      }

      table.clean-table td {
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        vertical-align: top;
      }

      table.clean-table tr:hover td {
        background: #faf8f4;
      }

      /* Footer */
      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        padding: 2.5rem 0;
        background: var(--bg-shelf);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--ink-secondary);
      }

      .footer-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 920px) {
        .hero-grid,
        .wb-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Top Sticky Bar -->
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="topbar-inner">
        <a href="/" class="brand">
          <span class="brand-title">The Complete Language Industry Atlas</span>
          <span class="brand-tag">100% Open · Zero Paywalls</span>
        </a>
        <nav class="nav-links">
          <a href="#bookshelf">20-Volume Bookshelf</a>
          <a href="#live-tool-workbench">Live QE / OpenLoc Tools</a>
          <a href="#databases-explorer">11 Relational Databases</a>
          <a href="/00-architecture/01-master-atlas/">Master Architecture</a>
          <a href="/19-volumes/ch01-modelfront-openloc-blueprint/">ModelFront & OpenLoc Blueprint</a>
          <a href="/01-volumes/ch01-definition-scope-purpose/" class="nav-cta">Read Vol 1 Ch 1.1 →</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="hero-grid">
            <div>
              <div class="hero-eyebrow">
                <span>LANGUAGE.SHASHWAT.WTF</span>
                <span>·</span>
                <span>20 VOLUMES · 18 DOMAINS · OPEN TOOL SUITE</span>
              </div>
              <h1>Pull any volume off the shelf. Inspect the entire global language economy.</h1>
              <p class="hero-lead">
                An exhaustive, empirical map of the <strong>$72B+ language services & technology market</strong> and the <strong>$200B+ wider language economy</strong>—paired with live interactive tools for <strong>AI Quality Prediction (QE)</strong>, <strong>Automatic Post-Editing (APE)</strong>, and <strong>OpenLoc AI-native TMS workflows</strong>. Every chapter, database, and tool is unlocked and open.
              </p>
              <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="#bookshelf" class="btn-primary">Browse the 20-Volume Bookshelf ↓</a>
                <a href="#live-tool-workbench" class="btn-secondary">Launch QE / OpenLoc Workbench</a>
                <a href="/19-volumes/ch01-modelfront-openloc-blueprint/" class="btn-secondary">Read the ModelFront & OpenLoc Playbook →</a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="hero-metrics">
              <div class="metric-box">
                <div class="metric-val">$71.7B–$75.7B</div>
                <div class="metric-label">Core Services & Tech (Nimdzi)</div>
              </div>
              <div class="metric-box">
                <div class="metric-val">20 Volumes</div>
                <div class="metric-label">100+ Verticals · 60+ File Formats</div>
              </div>
              <div class="metric-box">
                <div class="metric-val">11 Databases</div>
                <div class="metric-label">Companies, Tools, Pairs, Workflows</div>
              </div>
              <div class="metric-box">
                <div class="metric-val">QE + OpenLoc</div>
                <div class="metric-label">Live AI Verification Sandbox</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Architecture Deliverables 1-7 Ribbon -->
      <section class="arch-ribbon">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="arch-ribbon-header">
            <span class="arch-ribbon-title">00 — Master Architecture & Roadmap Deliverables (Click Any Card to Open)</span>
            <a href="/00-architecture/02-coverage-matrix/" style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--ink-primary); font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">View Full Coverage Matrix →</a>
          </div>
          <div class="arch-pills">
            {archDocs.map((doc) => (
              <a href={doc.href} class="arch-pill">
                <div class="arch-pill-top">
                  <span>{doc.title}</span>
                  <span class="arch-pill-num">{doc.num}</span>
                </div>
                <span class="arch-pill-desc">{doc.desc}</span>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- THE INTERACTIVE 20-VOLUME SHELF OF BOOKS -->
      <section id="bookshelf" class="bookshelf-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="shelf-controls">
            <div class="shelf-heading">
              <h2>The 20-Volume Language Industry Bookshelf</h2>
              <p>Click any book spine or cover to pull it off the shelf, preview its chapters, or jump straight into the full text.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="filter-bar">
              <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All 20 Volumes</button>
              <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="layer-1">Layer 1: Industry & Markets (I–IV)</button>
              <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="layer-2">Layer 2: Ops, Files & Verticals (V–XII)</button>
              <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="layer-3">Layer 3: Economics & AI Shift (XIII–XVII)</button>
              <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="layer-4">Layer 4: What to Build (XVIII–XX)</button>
              <input
                type="search"
                id="shelf-search-input"
                class="shelf-search"
                placeholder="Filter books (e.g. XLIFF, Clinical, AI, Pricing)..."
                aria-label="Filter books on shelf"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bookshelf-grid" id="bookshelf-grid">
            {books.map((b, idx) => (
              <div
                class="book-slot"
                data-category={b.category}
                data-search={`${b.title} ${b.subtitle} ${b.summary}`.toLowerCase()}
              >
                <div
                  class="book-card"
                  style={`background: ${b.coverBg};`}
                  data-book-index={idx}
                  role="button"
                  tabindex="0"
                  aria-label={`Open Volume ${b.num}: ${b.title}`}
                >
                  <div class="book-spine" style={`background-color: ${b.spineColor};`}>
                    <span class="spine-num">VOL {b.num}</span>
                    <span class="spine-roman">{b.roman}</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="book-cover">
                    <div>
                      <div class="book-top-meta">
                        <span class="book-layer-tag">{b.layerLabel}</span>
                        <span class="book-ai-pill" style={`color: ${b.accent};`}>AI {b.disruption}</span>
                      </div>
                      <div class="book-title-area">
                        <span class="book-vol-label" style={`color: ${b.accent};`}>Volume {b.num} · {b.roman}</span>
                        <h3 class="book-title">{b.title}</h3>
                        <p class="book-subtitle">{b.subtitle}</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="book-bottom-meta">
                      <span>{b.chaptersCount} Chapters</span>
                      <span class="book-open-cta" style={`color: ${b.accent};`}>Pull Book →</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Book Drawer Modal (Opens on Book Click) -->
      <div class="book-drawer-backdrop" id="book-drawer-backdrop" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="book-drawer" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="drawer-title">
          <button class="drawer-close" id="drawer-close-btn">✕ ESC</button>
          <div class="drawer-eyebrow" id="drawer-eyebrow">VOLUME 01 · LAYER 1</div>
          <h3 class="drawer-title" id="drawer-title">Volume Title</h3>
          <p class="drawer-summary" id="drawer-summary">Summary</p>
          <div class="drawer-chapters-title">Chapters & Sections Inside This Volume (All Open)</div>
          <ul class="drawer-chapter-list" id="drawer-chapter-list"></ul>
          <div class="drawer-actions">
            <a href="/01-volumes/" id="drawer-primary-link" class="btn-primary">Open Full Volume Reader →</a>
            <a href="/00-architecture/02-coverage-matrix/" class="btn-secondary">Check Coverage Matrix</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- LIVE INTERACTIVE TOOL WORKBENCH (MODELFRONT QE/APE + OPENLOC ROI + I18N LINTER) -->
      <section id="live-tool-workbench" class="workbench-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="workbench-header">
            <div>
              <div class="hero-eyebrow" style="color:#fbbf24;">
                <span>LIVE TOOL SUITE · OPEN PLAYGROUND</span>
                <span>·</span>
                <span>MODELFRONT QE/APE & OPENLOC ARCHITECTURE</span>
              </div>
              <h2>Interactive Localization AI & OpenLoc Workbench</h2>
              <p>
                We are building free, open tools right inside the Atlas that solve real localization engineering and AI verification bottlenecks—inspired by <strong>ModelFront</strong> (AI to check and fix AI translations) and <strong>OpenLoc</strong> (the open, AI-native TMS with zero AI tax). Try the three live tools below:
              </p>
            </div>
            <a href="/19-volumes/ch01-modelfront-openloc-blueprint/" class="btn-primary" style="background:#f59e0b; color:#111827;">
              Read Full ModelFront & OpenLoc Company Playbook →
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="workbench-tabs">
            <button class="wb-tab active" data-wb-tab="panel-qe">1. AI Quality Prediction (QE) & Automatic Post-Editing (APE)</button>
            <button class="wb-tab" data-wb-tab="panel-roi">2. OpenLoc Zero-AI-Tax & QE Savings Calculator</button>
            <button class="wb-tab" data-wb-tab="panel-linter">3. ICU MessageFormat, Placeholder & UI Expansion Linter</button>
          </div>

          <!-- Tool 1: QE & APE Simulator -->
          <div class="wb-panel active" id="panel-qe">
            <div class="wb-grid">
              <div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="qe-preset">Load Real-World Enterprise Test Case</label>
                  <select id="qe-preset" class="wb-select">
                    <option value="pass">Case 1: High-Confidence SaaS UI String (EN → DE) — Auto-Approve</option>
                    <option value="placeholder">Case 2: Broken ICU Placeholder & Glossary Defect (EN → JA) — APE Auto-Fix</option>
                    <option value="clinical">Case 3: High-Risk Clinical Dosage Negation Mistranslation (EN → ES) — Trigger Human Review</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="qe-source">Source Segment + Context Metadata</label>
                  <textarea id="qe-source" class="wb-textarea">Export &#123;count&#125; ledger transactions to CSV for fiscal audit.</textarea>
                </div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="qe-mt">Raw LLM / NMT Candidate Translation</label>
                  <textarea id="qe-mt" class="wb-textarea">Exportieren Sie &#123;count&#125; Hauptbuchtransaktionen als CSV für die Steuerprüfung.</textarea>
                </div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="qe-glossary">Required TBX Glossary & Risk Tier</label>
                  <input id="qe-glossary" class="wb-input" value="ledger=Hauptbuch | fiscal audit=Jahresabschlussprüfung | Tier=2 (B2B SaaS)" />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="wb-output-card">
                <div class="qe-score-banner">
                  <div>
                    <div class="wb-label">Predicted Quality Score (QE)</div>
                    <div class="qe-score-big" id="qe-score-val" style="color:#34d399;">94.2%</div>
                  </div>
                  <span class="qe-decision-badge" id="qe-decision-badge" style="background:#064e3b; color:#6ee7b7;">
                    ✓ SKIP HUMAN REVIEW (AUTO-PUBLISH)
                  </span>
                </div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <span class="wb-label">Automatic Post-Editing (APE) Verified Target Output</span>
                  <div id="qe-ape-output" style="padding:0.75rem; background:#181b20; border:1px solid #2e323b; border-radius:6px; font-family:var(--font-mono); font-size:0.84rem; color:#f9fafb;">
                    Exportieren Sie &#123;count&#125; Hauptbuchtransaktionen als CSV für die Jahresabschlussprüfung.
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="wb-label">Deterministic & Neural Verification Telemetry</span>
                <ul class="qe-checks" id="qe-checks-list">
                  <li style="color:#6ee7b7;">[PASS] Inline placeholder `&#123;count&#125;` preserved identically in source and target.</li>
                  <li style="color:#fbbf24;">[APE FIX] Enforced glossary term `fiscal audit` → `Jahresabschlussprüfung`.</li>
                  <li style="color:#6ee7b7;">[PASS] German text expansion (+26%) fits within 120-char table header limit.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tool 2: OpenLoc & QE ROI Calculator -->
          <div class="wb-panel" id="panel-roi">
            <div class="wb-grid">
              <div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="roi-words">Annual Localization Volume (Source Words)</label>
                  <input type="number" id="roi-words" class="wb-input" value="10000000" step="500000" />
                </div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="roi-rate">Average Human Post-Editing / TEP Rate ($ USD / Word)</label>
                  <input type="number" id="roi-rate" class="wb-input" value="0.14" step="0.01" />
                </div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="roi-auto-pct">Words Safely Verified by QE + APE (% Skipping Manual Review)</label>
                  <input type="number" id="roi-auto-pct" class="wb-input" value="78" min="10" max="98" />
                </div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="roi-tms-tax">Legacy Proprietary TMS Seat + AI Word-Tax ($ USD / Year)</label>
                  <input type="number" id="roi-tms-tax" class="wb-input" value="85000" step="5000" />
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="wb-output-card">
                <div class="qe-score-banner">
                  <div>
                    <div class="wb-label">Estimated Annual Enterprise Savings</div>
                    <div class="qe-score-big" id="roi-savings-val" style="color:#34d399;">$1,097,000 / yr</div>
                  </div>
                  <span class="qe-decision-badge" style="background:#064e3b; color:#6ee7b7;">
                    74.3% COST REDUCTION
                  </span>
                </div>
                <ul class="qe-checks" id="roi-breakdown-list">
                  <li>Traditional 100% Human TEP + Legacy TMS Cost: <strong id="roi-trad-cost" style="color:#f87171;">$1,485,000 / yr</strong></li>
                  <li>OpenLoc (Open TMS, $0 AI Tax) + QE Verification + 22% Targeted Human Review: <strong id="roi-modern-cost" style="color:#6ee7b7;">$388,000 / yr</strong></li>
                  <li>Words Automated with Verified Human Quality: <strong id="roi-auto-words" style="color:#fbbf24;">7,800,000 words</strong></li>
                  <li>Human Linguist Focus: <strong style="color:#93c5fd;">100% concentrated on the 22% highest-risk segments</strong></li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tool 3: i18n & Placeholder Linter -->
          <div class="wb-panel" id="panel-linter">
            <div class="wb-grid">
              <div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="lint-source">Source String (ICU MessageFormat / XLIFF / JSON)</label>
                  <textarea id="lint-source" class="wb-textarea">Hello &#123;userName&#125;, you have &#123;itemCount, plural, one &#123;# unread notification&#125; other &#123;# unread notifications&#125;&#125; in &lt;g id="1"&gt;Workspace&lt;/g&gt;.</textarea>
                </div>
                <div class="wb-field">
                  <label class="wb-label" for="lint-target">Target String to Audit (Try deleting `&#123;userName&#125;` or `&lt;/g&gt;` to test!)</label>
                  <textarea id="lint-target" class="wb-textarea">Hallo &#123;userName&#125;, Sie haben &#123;itemCount, plural, one &#123;# ungelesene Benachrichtigung&#125; other &#123;# ungelesene Benachrichtigungen&#125;&#125; im &lt;g id="1"&gt;Arbeitsbereich&lt;/g&gt;.</textarea>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="wb-output-card">
                <div class="qe-score-banner">
                  <div>
                    <div class="wb-label">i18n AST & Tag Verification Status</div>
                    <div class="qe-score-big" id="lint-status-val" style="color:#34d399;">PASS (0 Defects)</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <ul class="qe-checks" id="lint-results-list"></ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 11 RELATIONAL DATABASES EXPLORER -->
      <section id="databases-explorer" class="db-section">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="shelf-controls">
            <div class="shelf-heading">
              <h2>11 Linked Relational Industry Databases</h2>
              <p>Live structured datasets from <code>src/data/*.json</code> (Part 29 & Addendum D). Switch tabs below or open the <a href="/databases/" style="color:var(--ink-primary); font-weight:600;">Full-Page Database View →</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="db-tabs">
            <button class="db-tab active" data-db-tab="db-companies">1. Companies ({companiesData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-tools">2. Software & Tools ({toolsData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-formats">3. File Formats ({formatsData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-pairs">4. Language Pairs ({pairsData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-countries">5. Countries ({countriesData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-workflows">6. Workflows ({workflowsData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-standards">7. Standards ({standardsData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-careers">8. Careers ({careersData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-opps">9. Venture Opportunities ({opportunitiesData.records.length})</button>
            <button class="db-tab" data-db-tab="db-segments">10. Industry Segments ({segmentsData.records.length})</button>
          </div>

          <div class="db-panel active" id="db-companies">
            <table class="clean-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>Company</th>
                  <th>HQ</th>
                  <th>Category</th>
                  <th>Verified Revenue & Source</th>
                  <th>Core Technology</th>
                  <th>Strategic Moat</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
